  "task_id": "tmm_optimize_a_24_layer_alternating_tio2_siefke_sio2_4b687ede25",
  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 24-layer alternating TiO2 (Siefke)/SiO2 (Gao) dichroic coating on fused silica substrate at 45 degree incidence for unpolarized light. The stack sequence is TiO2 (Siefke)-SiO2 (Gao) repeated 12 times. Fix the physical thickness ratio between TiO2 (Siefke) and SiO2 (Gao) layers at 1.667 (TiO2 (Siefke) thickness = 1.667 × SiO2 (Gao) base thickness). Optimize two parameters: base_SiO2 (Gao)_thickness_nm and global_thickness_scaling_factor. All 24 layer thicknesses are determined by: SiO2 (Gao) layers = base_SiO2 (Gao)_thickness_nm × scaling_factor, TiO2 (Siefke) layers = base_SiO2 (Gao)_thickness_nm × 1.667 × scaling_factor. Maximize reflectance in 450-650 nm band and transmittance in 700-1000 nm band. Use gradient-based optimization with bounds: base_SiO2 (Gao)_thickness_nm in [30, 120] nm, scaling_factor in [0.5, 2.0].",
